[30:59.60] Math will help with on-page SEO, while caching plugins like WP Rocket can optimize your site
[31:06.00] speed. Regardless of your platform, SEO research is essential. Tools like Ahrefs and SMrush are
[31:13.28] invaluable for understanding what your audience is searching for and how to target them effectively.
[31:18.72] Ahrefs excels at backlink analysis, showing you which sites link to your competitors
[31:24.24] and helping you build a strategy for acquiring your own links. Its Content Explorer feature
[31:29.84] identifies trending topics in your niche, providing inspiration for your content strategy.
[31:35.44] SMrush, on the other hand, offers robust keyword research, site audits, and competitive analysis.
[31:42.48] Its keyword magic tool is particularly useful for finding long-tail keywords with low competition.
[31:48.96] Both tools can be used to track your search rankings over time, giving you insights into
[31:54.24] what's working and what needs improvement. Now let's focus on the heart of your affiliate
[31:58.72] marketing strategy. Content creation. High-quality content is what attracts visitors to your site
[32:05.12] and persuades them to click your affiliate links. Start by conducting thorough keyword
