[34:49.52] Google Search Console to ensure your site is properly indexed. Off-page SEO focuses
[34:55.44] on building backlinks, which are links from other websites to yours. Backlinks signal to
[35:00.88] Google that your site is authoritative and trustworthy. One way to earn backlinks is by
[35:06.40] guest posting on related blogs. Another method is using H-A-R-O or Help a Reporter Out,
[35:13.60] where journalists seek expert insights for their articles. By providing valuable
[35:18.40] information, you can earn a backlink to your site. Creating shareable content like
[35:23.36] infographics or expert roundups is another effective strategy for attracting organic backlinks.
[35:29.84] While Amazon's affiliate program is a great starting point, it's essential to diversify
